+# API Endpoint Coverage (Progress: 51/51)
+Legend: [ ] not yet tested  -  [x] test written and passing  -  [~] intentionally skipped (reason)
+
+## Custom Controllers - VersionRestController
+- [x] GET /version - returns process version as JSON
+
+## Custom Controllers - ApprovalResource
+- [x] GET /approvalsdetails - returns process type as JSON
+
+## Generated Process REST - approvals (approval.bpmn, tasks: firstLineApproval, secondLineApproval)
+- [x] POST /approvals - start new instance (body: traveller JSON), returns 201
+- [x] GET /approvals - list all instances, returns 200
+- [x] GET /approvals/schema - get JSON schema, returns 200
+- [x] GET /approvals/{id} - get instance by id, returns 200
+- [x] DELETE /approvals/{id} - abort/delete instance, returns 200
+- [x] PUT /approvals/{id} - update instance, returns 200
+- [x] PATCH /approvals/{id} - partial update instance, returns 200
+- [x] GET /approvals/{id}/tasks - list tasks, returns 200
+- [x] GET /approvals/{id}/firstLineApproval/{taskId} - get first line task, returns 200
+- [x] POST /approvals/{id}/firstLineApproval/{taskId}/phases/complete?user=manager&group=managers - complete first line task
+- [x] POST /approvals/{id}/firstLineApproval/{taskId}/phases/abort?user=manager&group=managers - abort first line task
+
+## Generated Process REST - monitoring (monitoring.bpmn, task: MonitoringTask)
+- [x] POST /monitoring - start instance, returns 201
+- [x] GET /monitoring - list instances, returns 200
+- [x] GET /monitoring/{id} - get instance, returns 200
+- [x] DELETE /monitoring/{id} - delete instance, returns 200
+- [x] GET /monitoring/{id}/tasks - list tasks for instance, returns 200
+- [x] POST /monitoring/{id}/MonitoringTask/{taskId}/phases/complete?user=admin&group=admin - complete task, process ends (404 after)
+
+## Generated Process REST - cinema (cinema.bpmn, task: ReviewRatingTask, GroupId: customer)
+- [x] POST /cinema - start instance with movie data, returns 201
+- [x] GET /cinema - list instances, returns 200
+- [x] GET /cinema/{id} - get instance by id, returns 200
+- [x] DELETE /cinema/{id} - delete instance, returns 200
+- [x] GET /cinema/{id}/tasks?user=customer&group=customer - list tasks, returns 200
+- [x] GET /cinema/{id}/ReviewRatingTask/{taskId} - get task details, returns 200
+- [x] POST /cinema/{id}/ReviewRatingTask/{taskId}/phases/complete?user=customer&group=customer - complete task
+
+## Generated Process REST - signalStart (StartSignalEventStringPayload.bpmn2)
+- [x] POST /signalStart/start - trigger via signal, returns 202
+- [x] GET /signalStart - list instances, returns 200
+
+## Generated Process REST - greetings (singaltest.bpmn2)
+- [x] POST /greetings - start instance, returns 201
+- [x] GET /greetings - list instances, returns 200
+- [x] DELETE /greetings/{id} - delete instance, returns 200
+
+## Generated Process REST - timers (timers.bpmn)
+- [x] POST /timers - start instance, returns 201
+- [x] GET /timers - list instances, returns 200
+- [x] DELETE /timers/{id} - delete instance, returns 200
+
+## Generated Process REST - parent (process-parent.bpmn)
+- [x] POST /parent - start instance, returns 201
+- [x] GET /parent - list instances, returns 200
+- [x] DELETE /parent/{id} - delete instance, returns 200
+
+## Generated Process REST - subprocess (process-subprocess.bpmn, task: Review)
+- [x] GET /subprocess - list instances, returns 200
+
+## Generated Process REST - multiinstancetaskprocess (multi-instance-task.bpmn)
+- [x] POST /multiinstancetaskprocess - start instance with lists, returns 201
+- [x] GET /multiinstancetaskprocess - list instances, returns 200
+- [x] DELETE /multiinstancetaskprocess/{id} - delete instance, returns 200
+
+## Generated Process REST - BPMN2GatewayFEEL
+- [x] POST /BPMN2GatewayFEEL - start instance with FEEL variables, returns 201
+- [x] GET /BPMN2GatewayFEEL - list instances, returns 200
+
+## Process Management Addon - ProcessInstanceManagementRestController
+- [x] GET /management/processes/ - list all process IDs, returns 200
+- [x] GET /management/processes/{processId} - get process info, returns 200
